1
00:00:05,700 --> 00:00:06,870
What are you doing here?

2
00:00:08,430 --> 00:00:09,500
I came to see you.

3
00:00:10,430 --> 00:00:11,570
How is your wound?

4
00:00:12,500 --> 00:00:13,300
Does it still hurt?

5
00:00:18,830 --> 00:00:20,330
My lord, it is late.

6
00:00:21,030 --> 00:00:22,130
Were you thinking of me?

7
00:00:29,330 --> 00:00:30,670
My lord, you are so fierce.

8
00:00:31,100 --> 00:00:32,670
I only showed you a little concern.

9
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,530
Yet you look as if you want to devour me.

10
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:36,930
I have been too indulgent with you.

11
00:00:37,230 --> 00:00:38,730
I fed you two extra pieces of meat,

12
00:00:38,830 --> 00:00:40,730
and now your tail is about to rise to the heavens.

13
00:00:42,630 --> 00:00:44,070
Only a dog would not dare to act out.

14
00:00:44,800 --> 00:00:46,200
What you fed was a wolf.

15
00:00:46,900 --> 00:00:47,730
An ungrateful wolf.

16
00:00:50,830 --> 00:00:54,030
There is no friend in this world more loyal than a wolf.

17
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:59,530
A debt of kindness is the chain that binds him.

18
00:01:01,530 --> 00:01:03,600
My lord, let us make a deal.

19
00:01:03,830 --> 00:01:04,900
I owe you a debt.

20
00:01:05,730 --> 00:01:07,470
So I will let you bind me with that chain.

21
00:01:08,330 --> 00:01:09,870
If the chain is in my hand,

22
00:01:10,300 --> 00:01:11,230
you will not run?

23
00:01:11,630 --> 00:01:12,430
I will not run.

24
00:01:13,400 --> 00:01:15,670
My lord, I will always be yours.

25
00:01:21,730 --> 00:01:23,200
If you dare run, I will kill you.

26
00:01:23,200 --> 00:01:24,130
I will not run.

27
00:01:24,630 --> 00:01:26,000
As long as you tug the chain,

28
00:01:26,730 --> 00:01:27,530
I will come.

29
00:01:38,300 --> 00:01:40,570
Don't look. Please.

30
00:01:40,570 --> 00:01:41,870
Don't be afraid.

31
00:01:43,330 --> 00:01:44,200
Helian Zhao.

32
00:01:44,700 --> 00:01:45,700
Call me Gerile.

33
00:01:46,130 --> 00:01:48,270
That is my real name.

34
00:01:49,729 --> 00:01:50,630
Gerile.

35
00:02:47,570 --> 00:02:48,930
It is still so early.

36
00:02:49,270 --> 00:02:50,470
My lord, are you leaving already?

37
00:02:50,829 --> 00:02:51,770
I am not as idle as you.

38
00:02:53,329 --> 00:02:55,070
Then would my lord be willing to keep an idler?

39
00:02:55,800 --> 00:02:57,930
I do not keep idlers under my command.

40
00:02:58,630 --> 00:03:00,030
What about under your body?

41
00:03:00,930 --> 00:03:01,730
Get lost.

42
00:03:03,330 --> 00:03:04,600
The way you look right now

43
00:03:04,830 --> 00:03:06,100
is like a well-fed dog.

44
00:03:06,670 --> 00:03:07,470
My lord.

45
00:03:08,070 --> 00:03:09,970
In this world, only you treat me like a dog.

46
00:03:10,370 --> 00:03:11,600
I am different from them.

47
00:03:12,200 --> 00:03:13,570
You said that yourself.

48
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:15,630
Last night, you said you would repay my kindness.

49
00:03:16,970 --> 00:03:17,770
What kindness?

50
00:03:24,600 --> 00:03:25,570
This was left to me by my father.

51
00:03:25,600 --> 00:03:26,500
It is the only relic he left behind.

52
00:03:26,870 --> 00:03:28,130
I want to know its origin.

53
00:03:28,600 --> 00:03:29,570
What do you want me to do?

54
00:03:30,770 --> 00:03:31,870
It is nothing troublesome.

55
00:03:32,770 --> 00:03:34,570
When my lord searches

56
00:03:34,570 --> 00:03:36,230
Chen Lunda's residence in the future,

57
00:03:37,130 --> 00:03:39,329
I hope you can look into the origin of this jade pendant for me.

58
00:03:42,630 --> 00:03:43,400
You want me to investigate,

59
00:03:43,400 --> 00:03:44,430
yet you will not give me the jade pendant.

60
00:03:44,430 --> 00:03:45,329
What sort of logic is that?

61
00:03:45,630 --> 00:03:46,870
Anything else under heaven,

62
00:03:46,870 --> 00:03:48,430
I could offer up before my lord.

63
00:03:48,670 --> 00:03:50,470
But this is my father's relic.

64
00:03:50,530 --> 00:03:51,670
It cannot fall into another person's hands.

65
00:03:51,900 --> 00:03:52,670
Farewell.

66
00:03:56,630 --> 00:03:57,130
Are you angry?

67
00:03:57,770 --> 00:03:58,870
As if you are worthy.

68
00:03:59,470 --> 00:04:00,470
Liar.

69
00:04:05,430 --> 00:04:07,370
I came to ask my lord for a little interest.

70
00:04:08,770 --> 00:04:09,870
I am helping you,

71
00:04:10,830 --> 00:04:12,630
yet you come to demand interest from me?

72
00:04:14,270 --> 00:04:14,870
My lord.

73
00:04:14,930 --> 00:04:16,769
Her Highness the Imperial Noble Consort asks you to come over.

74
00:04:22,600 --> 00:04:23,400
Understood.

75
00:04:25,370 --> 00:04:25,830
Your matter,

76
00:04:25,830 --> 00:04:26,630
I will remember it.

77
00:04:29,000 --> 00:04:30,270
Then I thank you, my lord.

78
00:04:32,630 --> 00:04:34,970
What does Gerile mean?

79
00:04:37,330 --> 00:04:39,070
Light. It means light.

80
00:05:02,630 --> 00:05:03,430
Your Highness.

81
00:05:05,230 --> 00:05:06,030
Come here.

82
00:05:06,770 --> 00:05:08,130
How is your health?

83
00:05:08,500 --> 00:05:09,370
I am already much better.

84
00:05:09,570 --> 00:05:10,730
Your Highness need not worry.

85
00:05:11,030 --> 00:05:12,000
Allow me to attend to Your Highness.

86
00:05:12,730 --> 00:05:15,330
If Prince Sheng knew how to please people as you do,

87
00:05:15,330 --> 00:05:16,500
I would have far fewer worries.

88
00:05:16,570 --> 00:05:18,130
His Highness is devoted to Your Highness.

89
00:05:18,230 --> 00:05:19,870
No one else could compare, no matter how much they did.

90
00:05:19,930 --> 00:05:21,470
What use is devotion alone?

91
00:05:21,470 --> 00:05:23,100
He is, after all, a bastard born of a palace maid.

92
00:05:23,100 --> 00:05:24,330
Useless mud that cannot be propped up.

93
00:05:25,230 --> 00:05:26,900
Even the most useless mud has been propped up this far.

94
00:05:27,330 --> 00:05:28,770
Though Prince Sheng cannot compare to Prince Yu,

95
00:05:29,170 --> 00:05:30,470
his strength lies in being easy to control.

96
00:05:31,270 --> 00:05:32,730
Your Highness has grown thinner these past two days.

97
00:05:35,230 --> 00:05:37,470
In the end, you are the one I raised from childhood.

98
00:05:38,070 --> 00:05:39,630
Your bond with me is unlike that of others.

99
00:05:39,970 --> 00:05:40,870
Yes.

100
00:05:41,130 --> 00:05:41,930
Without Your Highness,

101
00:05:42,930 --> 00:05:43,970
I, in this deep palace,

102
00:05:43,970 --> 00:05:46,130
might not have survived until today.

103
00:06:05,670 --> 00:06:07,630
Do not be afraid. Mother is here.

104
00:06:11,830 --> 00:06:12,830
Mother.

105
00:06:13,100 --> 00:06:13,900
Mother.

106
00:06:21,430 --> 00:06:22,300
Mingke.

107
00:06:26,830 --> 00:06:28,570
You dog who colluded with the enemy and betrayed the nation!

108
00:06:28,570 --> 00:06:29,230
Go die!

109
00:06:29,330 --> 00:06:30,770
Kill him! Kill him!

110
00:06:50,300 --> 00:06:51,070
Enough.

111
00:06:52,330 --> 00:06:53,030
Continue.

112
00:06:53,470 --> 00:06:54,270
Yes.

113
00:06:56,530 --> 00:06:58,570
Your Highness, Eunuch Li requests an audience.

114
00:06:59,330 --> 00:07:00,470
Let him in.

115
00:07:01,100 --> 00:07:01,900
Yes.

116
00:07:05,570 --> 00:07:07,100
Greetings, Your Highness the Imperial Noble Consort.

117
00:07:07,100 --> 00:07:08,270
Greetings, Lord Commander.

118
00:07:09,000 --> 00:07:10,000
Eunuch, what brings you to Changle Palace?

119
00:07:10,000 --> 00:07:10,970
What brings you here?

120
00:07:11,170 --> 00:07:12,230
In reply to Your Highness,

121
00:07:12,230 --> 00:07:14,200
I have come to deliver His Majesty's verbal decree.

122
00:07:14,200 --> 00:07:15,470
Prince Yu enters the capital today.

123
00:07:15,470 --> 00:07:17,570
His Majesty orders Lord Commander and Young General Helian

124
00:07:17,570 --> 00:07:19,270
to go together and escort Prince Yu back to the palace.

125
00:07:19,270 --> 00:07:20,400
Then go.

126
00:07:23,300 --> 00:07:24,070
I obey the decree.

127
00:07:34,630 --> 00:07:36,800
My lord, why are you here?

128
00:07:36,970 --> 00:07:38,300
I just received His Majesty's decree.

129
00:07:38,500 --> 00:07:40,930
I am to accompany my lord to escort Prince Yu.

130
00:07:42,830 --> 00:07:43,930
You arrived rather quickly.

131
00:07:45,770 --> 00:07:46,930
Not just quickly.

132
00:07:47,230 --> 00:07:49,130
I even brought my lord's horse.

133
00:07:49,130 --> 00:07:50,030
It is over there.

134
00:07:52,630 --> 00:07:54,730
Am I not very considerate?

135
00:07:55,270 --> 00:07:57,130
I am being thoughtful of my lord's exertions last night.

136
00:07:57,130 --> 00:07:58,470
You still have the nerve to say that?

137
00:07:58,730 --> 00:07:59,830
It was my fault.

138
00:07:59,830 --> 00:08:01,230
I did not know when to stop.

139
00:08:01,430 --> 00:08:02,970
My lord, punish me.

140
00:08:11,930 --> 00:08:13,130
My lord, wait for me.

141
00:08:21,870 --> 00:08:22,930
Why is my lord not speaking?

142
00:08:22,970 --> 00:08:23,770
Shut up.

143
00:08:25,200 --> 00:08:26,200
Does your waist still ache?

144
00:08:27,730 --> 00:08:28,930
Keep babbling, and you can get lost.

145
00:08:32,270 --> 00:08:33,400
Do not worry, my lord.

146
00:08:34,600 --> 00:08:35,530
Tonight...

147
00:08:49,400 --> 00:08:49,870
Stop.

148
00:08:50,170 --> 00:08:51,000
Chu Mingke!

149
00:08:51,070 --> 00:08:52,270
You are murdering your own husband!

150
00:08:53,300 --> 00:08:53,970
Hyah!
